{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9122ac60b43587305b1f92ad080ca395a60e366250f22690c83d20451b1be8c1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78b2ec04d3a8e07d704ffeda737bff94a6215c3062555e706e354e295feb9fde",
      "text": "极秘的圆桌会议",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:323396c32720c4e0c6a4e51f393f5121bffdea4047e80dd1be4262182de75d3b",
      "text": "阿斯兰的生日临近，Cafe Parade的\n大家开始策划惊喜派对。\n然而，由于背着他商量和准备的次数增加，\n导致阿斯兰产生了某种误会……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27b8d2d9c249a81e4aeb4dcbfa5181a154d0626b45f209d3fb603686876e0336",
      "text": "铛铛——！\n拉花彩旗赶上了哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0c772bd74936cdc6d4470b199123a37fb8e696730297a596eea699cdbe4020c",
      "text": "嚯，做得很不错呢。\n阿斯兰肯定也会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71f219e281c0d06bc1e508fa88dd874bec877446065bc6bd96c663f9a9043695",
      "text": "很棒呢。我这边也做好了\n仿照撒旦先生制作的杏仁糖糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:368a2211c2416c822156cd86be402c27408960997c97275fd64fedd7527d3297",
      "text": "超级可爱！他肯定会很高兴的！\n真期待蛋糕完成呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fc4b7d30c3a51e957842cddf0fa4a7744ce094fef6750b7a483520a354fa2b2",
      "text": "来吧。为了办一场精彩的派对，\n进行最后的收尾吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41a4b287684f4299d6b19a705cc19c2779c38dca57e6675c4ba1d51fc0ecce4b",
      "text": "我从制作人那里，\n听说了筹备派对期间的事哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab1adb85143949537bc0d1e62b83a5c05d82f6a631208797303ee7f227021a6a",
      "text": "让你感到不安真是对不起。\n我们只是想给阿斯兰一个惊喜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a83435c6ac7bf73d044fefeb53b816bb271488c127496f4fdab4eabb4e96d8af",
      "text": "汝在言何，神谷！推开门扉那一瞬\n激昂的心跳，已然深刻于吾之记忆之中。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5c02fecf1e6f695633c82b6cb11e0836b965b7df7ecbabe15fec20035b077bd",
      "text": "璀璨之盛宴，正是吾等暗之同胞团\n羁绊之证明！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d074427fd4bcfb6e9c648ae7599ed85b3577693109b271af0b05202340df8877",
      "text": "这样啊。那就好。\n今后也请多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5e10dc366b49677a5d121c92f9c451a9c1597b0aeade050d494ca5fe0690882",
      "text": "镇坐于满载罪孽诱惑的供物之上的\n撒旦肖像。实乃精妙绝伦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b04958d23df9693648ca4115716eed29486213a7cb8c6f08b4114d7aeb3aec6",
      "text": "是指撒旦先生的杏仁糖糕吗？\n谢谢夸奖。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:417bb395f6f5874d019cad3da58f4f0358b20d064ac79214d80ee23bf94c14c6",
      "text": "那是大家商量着“他一定会很高兴的”\n而制作出来的。看来努力很值得呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da71cd3e1468c20998c3a346a517c66fed881a9e54184d5be70eafeda00a0563",
      "text": "库库……看来同胞们对吾魔力之根源，\n已是了如指掌！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c238a4ed9e8d102fff2e6c863e76ef7f594f6b19bb8097a8dd1db9adbfd46c14",
      "text": "呵呵，明年也请好好期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0f71de28dce69d2b142f61d79be9f5e5e8871f26624afae43016a8e219373a0",
      "text": "吾瞬间便已洞悉，此番盛宴奉上之供物与装潢，\n皆乃强力魔术之显现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45e8cbfb42e858d681e281b0dfd85c252bf636e9c90ecb3ae6be095e8eb66593",
      "text": "谢谢！大家真的都\n超级起劲地在准备呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57d529fb4ed1ae4da1bc841fd88b9bb0d5f2c1cbcbf4ba574c3d634182e1c606",
      "text": "当然，我也是。我为了能让阿斯兰先生高兴，\n想了好多好多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9237fd82736ad8ccbe547345cf1e390115ca53a731f4dea5408f216b711bdeb7",
      "text": "卷绪啊，\n那份情念已切实传达到了吾之胸怀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cedc045dff797652b7495b9ba259af149663ba7db146ace7004cc3fc855e547",
      "text": "汝与同胞们为筹备暗黑盛宴所行之暗跃，\n吾于此予以赞颂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:193bd1f6bf88d7fff7f066f3d2050888d5d26db7b04585f8631f313c201ac460",
      "text": "呐，阿斯兰！\n装饰的彩旗，你看了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:029b820717944859fe93cfe0b1ae78dc893b0100b6964bfc38889a70e754eb51",
      "text": "嗯。宛如撒旦翻涌的魔力般\n不祥的形状，实乃令人心潮澎湃之装潢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:838e20afcf798bbd941edaedce3e390ad2aa5e4698bf4382ccc4dbf8cc254f9d",
      "text": "太好啦～！那个装饰，是为了让阿斯兰\n开心，我特意做出来的哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ceff084a6b73c42aaef5bbdb93115ea11e0bf16bbdcd4f8380103bef493eac4",
      "text": "原来如此。\n真不愧是啪噼族的秘术。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6645eb00a759f8d46a7f4cbc0d9caed2035171913ae2697e31ae2c0887094dd",
      "text": "咲的魔术与审美，\n亦入得了撒旦的法眼。容吾再次致谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
